    {
      "id": "qa_1772092904644_rkus6yoq",
      "question": "Bpt mein admission ke liye kya kya hona chahiye",
      "answer": "BPT (Bachelor of Physiotherapy) mein admission ke liye KGMU mein kuch eligibility criteria aur documents ki requirement hoti hai. Generally, ismein shamil hain:\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\n\n*   **Educational Qualification:** Aapko 10+2 pass hona chahiye, preferably science stream se (Physics, Chemistry, Biology ke saath). Minimum marks ka criteria university dwara specify kiya jaata hai, jo website par available hota hai.\n*   **Age Limit:** Kuch universities mein age limit bhi ho sakti hai.\n\n**Required Documents (General List, exact list KGMU ki website par check karein):**\n\n*   **Mark Sheets:** 10th aur 12th class ki mark sheets.\n*   **Passing Certificate:** 10th aur 12th class ke passing certificates.\n*   **Admit Card & Scorecard:** Entrance exam (agar koi ho) ka admit card aur scorecard.\n*   **ID Proof:** Aadhar card, Voter ID, ya koi anya sarkari pehchan patra.\n*   **Category Certificate:** Agar aap reserved category se hain (SC/ST/OBC), toh uska certificate.\n*   **Character Certificate:** School/College se character certificate.\n*   **Migration Certificate:** Agar aap kisi other board/university se hain.\n*   **Passport Size Photographs:** Recent passport size photos.\n*   **Domicile Certificate:** Uttar Pradesh domicile certificate agar applicable ho.\n\n**Admission Process:**\n\n*   **Entrance Exam:** KGMU mein BPT ke liye admission generally entrance exam ke through hota hai. Iske liye KGMU ki website par apply karna hota hai.\n*   **Counselling:** Entrance exam ke baad, merit list ke basis par counselling hoti hai jismein seats allocate ki jaati hain.\n\n**Sabse sahi aur latest jaankari ke liye, KGMU ki official website www.kgmu.org par \"Admissions\" section ko visit karna bahut zaroori hai.** Wahan par aapko BPT course ke liye specific eligibility criteria, important dates, application process, aur required documents ki poori list mil jayegi.",
